# Non-Python package data shipped inside the cv_editor wheel: the editor's
# Jinja templates + static assets, and the bundled example corpus (the
# reset-to-example / blank-CV seed reached via importlib.resources when no
# engine-root data/example is present — see cv_editor.paths.example_dir).
recursive-include scripts/cv_editor/templates *.html
recursive-include scripts/cv_editor/static *
recursive-include scripts/cv_editor/example_data *
include LICENSE README.md
